{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_1","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"上古之世，草衣木食，巢居穴處，熙熙于于，不求不爭。爰自炎帝政衰，蚩尤作亂，始制干戈，以毒天下。軒轅氏作，戮之涿鹿之阿。處則象吻于宮，行則懸旄于纛，以為天下萬世戒。於是師兵營衛，不得不設矣。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_2","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"冀州以南，歷洪水之變，夏后始制城郭。其人土著而居綏服之中，外奮武衛，內揆文教，守在四邊。營衛之設，以備非常而已。并、營以北，勁風多寒，隨陽遷徙，歲無寧居，曠土萬里，寇賊姦宄乘隙而作。營衛之設，以為常然。其勢然也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_3","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"有遼始大，設制尤密。居有宮衛，謂之斡魯朵；出有行營，謂之捺缽；分鎮邊圉，謂之部族。有事則以攻戰為務，閑暇則以畋漁為生。無日不營，無在不衛。立國規模，莫重於此。作營衛志。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_4","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"宮衛","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_5","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"遼國之法：天子踐位置宮衛，分州縣，析部族，設官府，籍戶口，備兵馬。崩則扈從后妃宮帳，以奉陵寢。有調發，則丁壯從戎事，老弱居守。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_6","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"太祖曰弘義宮，應天皇后曰長寧宮，太宗曰永興宮，世宗曰積慶宮，穆宗曰延昌宮，景宗曰彰愍宮，承天太后曰崇德宮，聖宗曰興聖宮，興宗曰延慶宮，道宗曰太和宮，天祚曰永昌宮。又孝文皇太弟有敦睦宮，丞相耶律隆運有文忠王府。凡州三十八，縣十，提轄司四十一，石烈二十三，瓦里七十四，抹里九十八，得里二，閘撒十九。為正戶八萬，蕃漢轉戶十二萬三千，共二十萬三千戶。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_7","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"算斡魯朵，太祖置。國語心腹曰「算」，宮曰「斡魯朵」。是為弘義宮。以心腹之衛置，益以渤海俘，錦州戶。其斡魯朵在臨潢府，陵寢在祖州東南二十里。正戶八千，蕃漢轉戶七千，出騎軍六千。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_8","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"州五：錦、祖、嚴、祺、銀。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_9","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"縣一：富義。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_10","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"提轄司四：南京、西京、奉聖州、平州。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_11","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"石烈二：曰須，曰速魯。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_12","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"瓦里四：曰合不，曰撻撒，曰慢押，曰虎池。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_13","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"抹里四：曰膻，曰預墩，曰鶻突，曰糾里闡。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_14","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"得里二：曰述壘北，曰述壘南。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_15","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"國阿輦斡魯朵，太宗置。收國曰「國阿輦」。是為永興宮，初名孤穩斡魯朵。以太祖平渤海俘戶，東京、懷州提轄司及雲州懷仁縣、澤州灤河縣等戶置。其斡魯朵在游古河側，陵寢在懷州南三十里。正戶三千，蕃漢轉戶七千，出騎軍五千。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_16","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"州四：懷、黔、開、來。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_17","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"縣二：保和、灤河。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_18","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"提轄司四：南京、西京、奉聖州、平州。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_19","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"石烈一：北女古。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_20","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"瓦里四：曰抹，曰母，曰合李只，曰述壘。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_21","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"抹里十三：曰述壘軫，曰大隔蔑，曰小隔蔑，曰母，曰歸化不朮，曰唐括，曰吐谷，曰百爾瓜忒，曰合魯不只，曰移馬不只，曰膻，曰清帶，曰速穩。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_22","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"閘撒七：曰伯德部，曰守狘，曰穴骨只，曰合不頻尼，曰虎里狘，曰耶里只挾室，曰僧隱令公。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_23","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"耶魯碗斡魯朵，世宗置。興盛曰「耶魯碗」。是為積慶宮。以文獻皇帝衛從及太祖俘戶，及雲州提轄司，并高、宜等州戶置。其斡魯朵在土河東，陵寢在長寧宮北。正戶五千，蕃漢轉戶八千，出騎軍八千。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_24","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"州三：康、顯、宜。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_25","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"縣一：山東。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_26","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"提轄司四。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_27","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"石烈一：兮臘。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_28","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"瓦里八：曰達撒，曰合不，曰吸烈，曰逼里，曰潭馬，曰槊不，曰耶里直，曰耶魯兀也。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_29","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"抹里十：曰紇斯直，曰蠻葛，曰厥里，曰潭馬忒，曰出懶，曰速忽魯碗，曰牒里得，曰閻馬，曰迭里特，曰女古。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_30","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"蒲速碗斡魯朵，應天皇太后置。興隆曰「蒲速碗」。是為長寧宮。以遼州及海濱縣等戶置。其斡魯朵在高州，陵寢在龍化州東一百里。世宗分屬讓國皇帝宮院。正戶七千，蕃漢轉戶六千，出騎軍五千。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_31","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"州四：遼、儀坤、遼西、顯。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_32","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"縣三：奉先、歸義、定霸。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_33","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"提轄司四。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_34","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"石烈一：北女古。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_35","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"瓦里六：曰潭馬，曰合不，曰達撒，曰慢押，曰耶里只，曰渾只。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_36","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"抹里十三：曰渾得移鄰稍瓦只，曰合四卑臘因鐵里卑稍只，曰奪羅果只，曰拏葛只，曰合里只，曰婆渾昆母溫，曰阿魯埃得本，曰東冢里門，曰西冢里門，曰東钁里，曰西钁里，曰牒得只，曰滅母鄰母。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_37","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"奪里本斡魯朵，穆宗置。是為延昌宮。討平曰「奪里本」。以國阿輦斡魯朵戶及阻卜俘戶，中京提轄司、南京制置司、咸、信、韓等州戶置。其斡魯朵在糾雅里山南，陵寢在京南。正戶一千，蕃漢轉戶三千，出騎軍二千。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_38","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"州二：遂、韓。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_39","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"提轄司三：中京、南京、平州。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_40","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"石烈一：曰須。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_41","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"瓦里四：曰抹骨古等，曰兀沒，曰潭馬，曰合里直。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_42","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"抹里四：曰抹骨登兀沒滅，曰土木直移鄰，曰息州決里，曰莫瑰奪石。","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_43","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"監母斡魯朵，景宗置。是為彰愍宮。遺留曰「監母」。以章肅皇帝侍衛及武安州戶置。其斡魯朵在合魯河，陵寢在祖州南。正戶八千，蕃漢轉戶一萬，出騎軍一萬。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_44","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"州四：永、龍化、降聖、同。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_45","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"縣二：行唐、阜俗。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_46","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"提轄司四。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_47","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"石烈二：曰監母，曰南女古。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_48","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"瓦里七：曰潭馬，曰奚烈，曰埃合里直，曰蠻雅葛，曰特末，曰烏也，曰滅合里直。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_49","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"抹里十一：曰尼母曷烈因稍瓦直，曰察改因麻得不，曰移失鄰斡直，曰辛古不直，曰撒改真，曰牙葛直，曰虎狘阿里鄰，曰潑昆，曰潭馬，曰閘臘，曰楚兀真果鄰。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_50","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"孤穩斡魯朵，承天太后置。是為崇德宮。玉曰「孤穩」。以乾、顯、雙三州戶置。其斡魯朵在土河東，陵祔景宗皇帝。正戶六千，蕃漢轉戶一萬，出騎軍一萬。","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_51","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"州四：乾、川、雙、貴德。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_52","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"縣一：潞上京。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_53","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"提轄司三：南京、西京、奉聖州。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_54","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"石烈三：曰钁里，曰滂，曰迭里特女古。","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_55","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"瓦里七：曰達撒，曰耶里，曰合不，曰歇不，曰合里直，曰慢押，曰耶里直。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_56","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"抹里十一：曰阿里冢直述壘，曰預篤溫稍瓦直，曰潭馬，曰賃預篤溫一臘，曰牙葛直，曰牒得直，曰虎溫，曰孤溫，曰撒里僧，曰阿里葛斯過鄰，曰鐵里乖穩钁里。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_57","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"閘撒五：曰合不直迷里幾頻你，曰牒耳葛太保果直，曰爪里阿本果直，曰僧隱令公果直，曰老昆令公果直。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_58","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"女古斡魯朵，聖宗置。是為興聖宮。金曰「女古」。以國阿輦、耶魯碗、蒲速碗三斡魯朵戶置。其斡魯朵在女混活直，陵寢在慶州南安。正戶一萬，蕃漢轉戶二萬，出騎軍五千。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_59","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"州五：慶、隰、烏上京、烏東京、霸。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_60","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"提轄司四。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_61","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"石烈四：曰毫兀真女姑，曰拏兀真女室，曰女特里特，曰女古滂。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_62","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"瓦里六：曰女古，曰蒲速碗，曰鶻篤，曰乙抵，曰蓊，曰埃也。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_63","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"抹里九：曰乙辛不只，曰鐵乖溫，曰埃合里只，曰嘲瑰，曰合魯山血古只，曰奪忒排登血古只，曰勞骨，曰虛沙，曰土鄰。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_64","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"閘撒五：曰達鄰頻你，曰和里懶你，曰爪阿不厥真，曰粘獨里僧，曰袍達夫人厥只。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_65","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"窩篤碗斡魯朵，興宗置。是為延慶宮。孳息曰「窩篤碗」。以諸斡魯朵及饒州戶置。其斡魯朵在高州西，陵寢在上京慶州。正戶七千，蕃漢轉戶一萬，出騎軍一萬。","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_66","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"州三：饒、長春、泰。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_67","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"提轄司四。","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_68","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"石烈二：曰窩篤碗、曰鶻篤骨。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_69","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"瓦里六：曰窩篤碗，曰冢把，曰冢阿，曰糾里，曰得里，曰歐烈。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_70","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"抹里六：曰歐里本，曰燕冢，曰緬四，曰乙僧，曰北得里，曰南得里。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_71","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"阿思斡魯朵，道宗置。是為太和宮。寬大曰「阿思」。以諸斡魯朵御前承應人及興中府戶置。其斡魯朵在好水濼，陵寢在上京慶州。正戶一萬，蕃漢轉戶二萬，出騎軍一萬五千。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_72","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"石烈二：曰阿冢，曰耶魯。","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_73","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"瓦里八：曰阿冢，曰耶魯，曰得里，曰糾里，曰撒不，曰鶻篤，曰蒲速斡，曰曷烈。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_74","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"抹里七：曰恩州得里，曰斡奢得里，曰歐里本，曰特滿，曰查剌土鄰，曰糾里，曰阿里冢迷里。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_75","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"阿魯碗斡魯朵，天祚皇帝置。是為永昌宮。輔祐曰「阿魯碗」。以諸斡魯朵御前承應人，春、宣州戶置。正戶八千，蕃漢轉戶一萬，出騎軍一萬。","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_76","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"石烈二：曰阿魯碗，曰榆魯碗。","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_77","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"瓦里八：曰阿魯斡，曰合里也，曰鶻突，曰敵剌，曰謀魯斡，曰糾里，曰奪里剌，曰特末也。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_78","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"抹里八：曰蒲速碗，曰移輦，曰斡篤碗，曰特滿，曰謀魯碗，曰移典，曰悅，曰勃得本。","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_79","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"孝文皇太弟敦睦宮，謂之赤寔得本斡魯朵。孝曰「赤寔得本」。文獻皇帝承應人及渤海俘，建、瀋、巖三州戶置。陵寢在祖州西南三十里。正戶三千，蕃漢轉戶五千，出騎軍五千。","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_80","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"州三：建、瀋、巖。","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_81","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"提轄司一：南京。","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_82","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"石烈二：曰嘲，曰與敦。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_83","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"瓦里六：曰乙辛，曰得里，曰奚烈直，曰大潭馬，曰小潭馬，曰與墩。","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_84","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"抹里二：曰潭馬抹乖，曰柳實。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_85","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"閘撒二：曰聶里頻你，曰打里頻你。","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_86","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"大丞相晉國王耶律隆運，本韓氏，名德讓。以功賜國姓，出宮籍，隸橫帳季父房。賜尚書令，諡文忠。無子，以皇族魏王貼不子耶魯為嗣，早卒；天祚皇帝又以皇子敖魯斡繼之。官給葬具，建廟乾陵側。擬諸宮例，建文忠王府。正戶五千，蕃漢轉戶八千，出騎軍一萬。","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_87","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"州一。","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_88","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"提轄司六：上京、中京、南京、西京、奉聖州、平州。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_89","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"著帳郎君","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_90","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"著帳郎君：初，遙輦痕德堇可汗以蒲古只等三族害于越釋魯，籍沒家屬入瓦里。淳欽皇后宥之，以為著帳郎君。世宗悉免。後族、戚、世官犯罪者沒入。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_91","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"著帳戶","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_92","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"著帳戶：本諸斡魯朵析出，及諸罪沒入者。凡承應小底、司藏、鷹坊、湯藥、尚飲、盥漱、尚膳、尚衣、裁造等役，及宮中、親王祗從，伶官之屬，皆充之。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_31_93","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_31","textTraditional":"凡諸宮衛人丁四十萬八千，騎軍十萬一千。著帳釋宥、沒入，隨時增損，無常額。","sentenceOrder":93}],"overrides":{}}